OL,3,GNEWSAChildren escape injury in two
OL,4,Aseparate shootings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour children and three adults have
OL,7,Fescaped injury in two separate
OL,8,Fshootings in Coleraine in the early
OL,9,Fhours of Monday.
OL,11,FThe PSNI are treating both gun attacks
OL,12,Fas attempted murder.
OL,14,FPolice said they received a report at
OL,15,Fabout 00:10 BST that a number of shots
OL,16,Fhad been fired at a house on Maythorn
OL,17,FAvenue.
OL,19,FWhile dealing with this, officers then
OL,20,Freceived a further report that shots
OL,21,Fhad also been fired at a property on
OL,22,FSilverthorn Avenue at about 00:30.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
